What are your SYSFONT and SYSFONTACM settings in /etc/sysconfig/i18n?
And do you use the DECgraphics or IBMgraphics option?

I have both SYSFONT and SYSFONTACM commented out in my RH9 system, so the
system uses the ROM fonts and IBMgraphics works perfectly. 
I haven't found a suitable font to load that would show IBMgraphics
correctly in Nethack AND also display the Finnish character set, but the
fonts in the (display card?) rom do it.

Anyway, if you have neither DECgraphics nor IBMgraphics on, you should get
correct ascii display of the map, but it doesn't look as nice as it does
with properly handled IBMgraphics.

The bios and 8_bit_tty options don't affect the character set.

